00:16:07,060 --> 00:16:10,340
He was like, dude, can you help my wife, like, she's here.

221
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:13,240
And I'm like, dude, you're, like, 250 miles away from me.

222
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,560
No, I don't know anyone there.

223
00:16:16,060 --> 00:16:21,420
But her engine exploded because he kept putting off getting the oil changed.

224
00:16:21,420 --> 00:16:27,160
He told me, I could hear it, like, his voice quivering, Ryan, it's on my list of things to do.

225
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:30,220
