226
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:34,060
But he never got around to it.

227
00:16:34,060 --> 00:16:39,600
And because it piled up and piled up and piled up, she went on a long journey, and the engine blew up,

228
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:42,780
