00:16:44,260 --> 00:16:46,920
Like, it wasn't worth fixing.

231
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,480
But listen to what he said.

232
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:51,040
He said, I intended to do it.

233
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:53,520
I love how Andy Stanley says it.

234
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:58,320
