235
00:16:58,320 --> 00:17:05,160
Direction, like what we actually do, where we actually go, the things that we actually build into our life,

236
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:07,480
those are what determine where we end up.

237
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:14,120
Not what we want to do, not what we think about doing, not what we plan to do, but what we actually do.

238
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:20,940
And if we're going to persevere in our faith through hard, difficult times, when everything is working against us,

239
00:17:20,940 --> 00:17:24,040
when the world, the flesh, and the devil are all trying to get us off track,

240
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:31,240
and especially in seasons of trial, when we might be getting angry with God and other people in our lives,

241
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:35,140
and we might be giving the devil, the enemy, a foothold in our lives,

242
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:39,340
if we're not careful to pay attention to what we're actually doing, not what we intend to do,

243
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:41,120
but what we actually do,

244
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:45,820
we could end up like Demas and say, you know what?

245
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:48,820
This whole Jesus thing is fun while it lasts.

246
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:51,200
It's not worth it.

