00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:12,960
The author of Ecclesiastes calls it meaningless.

253
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:18,740
Demas left the faith, left the thing,

254
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:22,820
the abundant life for something that's meaningless,

255
00:18:22,820 --> 00:18:25,560
and if we're not careful to keep a close eye on our affections,

256
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:29,020
trials build up, difficulties build up, hard times build up,

257
00:18:29,020 --> 00:18:31,780
and before we know it, we might not even realize it,

258
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:35,660
we get to a place where we're in a really unhealthy place.

