296
00:20:30,320 --> 00:20:32,220
Those are downstream practices.

297
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:33,220
Those things come naturally.

298
00:20:33,220 --> 00:20:34,260
Playing golf, right?

299
00:20:34,260 --> 00:20:38,200
Like playing golf on a nice day for me just stirs my affections for Jesus.

300
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:39,860
It's a good gift from God.

301
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:41,000
Those are easy things.

302
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,900
They come naturally.

303
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:47,080
But then there's some upstream practices, like maybe a Sabbath, right?

304
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:50,560
Like maybe turning off your phone and, like, not doing anything.

