309
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:04,800
He wants a relationship with us.

310
00:21:04,800 --> 00:21:08,480
For some of you, the idea of a Sabbath, like that's an upstream practice.

311
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:09,040
That's hard.

312
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:11,500
That's something you're going to have to force yourself to do at the beginning.

313
00:21:11,500 --> 00:21:15,140
But the cool thing is as you force yourself to do some of those upstream practices,

314
00:21:15,140 --> 00:21:18,160
some of those upstream practices actually become downstream practices.

